    <string name="dialog_av1_software_title">⚠ AV1 Software fifi koodu</string>
    <string name="dialog_av1_software_message">Iyipada koodu Hardware AV1 ko ni atilẹyin lori ẹrọ yii.\n\n Gbigbasilẹ yoo ṣee ṣe nipa lilo Software AV1 (iyipada koodu CPU). Eyi le fa alekun lilo Sipiyu, agbara batiri ti o ga julọ, ati fireemu ti o pọju silẹ lori awọn ipinnu giga.</string>
